# Resurrection of an Old Manager (Q114), cond 4 to 12 on the second story (choice 2): Yumi ends
# it (cond 6), Wendy sends the character after her guardian (cond 10) and wakes it far away,
# one at a time: a second call sees it, and once it leaves after 300 s she wakes another.
# Killing a guardian (the npc line's) at cond 10 moves the quest to cond 11, and Wendy then
# moves it to cond 12. A woken guardian's line and its attack are not seen from here; the Boot
# test tests/quest/q114_golem_test.go covers them. Expectations replay the reference trace of
# this scenario.
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/q114_resurrection_of_an_old_manager_golem.golden
character Manager 49
quest Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager <cond>=4 <state>=STARTED choice=2 talk=2
script quest.Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager
item 57 8090 8091 8287 8288 8289
page default/32041.htm
page default/32047.htm
page script/quest/Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager/
npc yumi 32041 Folk 10 0 0
npc wendy 32047 Folk 20 0 0
npc golem 27318 Monster 0 30 0

# Yumi ends the second story.
action yumi
action yumi
