  Q upsert Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager | <cond> | 6
  Q upsert Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager | talk | 0
  rows Q114_ResurrectionOfAnOldManager <cond>=6 <flags>=-2147483601 <state>=STARTED choice=2 talk=0

